    "user_approval_marker": "outputs/phase-13/user-approval-<timestamp>.md",
    "scope": "Keep (do NOT delete) the admin requests queue (/admin/requests) and make it self-explanatory that it is the place where MEMBER-INITIATED requests (公開停止/再開 = visibility_request, 退会 = delete_request, submitted by the member from /me/visibility-request and /me/delete-request) are approved/rejected by an admin, which is a DIFFERENT axis from the admin-initiated immediate publish toggle in 会員管理 (/admin/members PATCH /admin/members/:id/status). Three lanes, all completable in one implementation cycle: (A) SEED — add 3 pending requests (1 visibility_request desiredState=hidden on a currently-public TEST member, 1 visibility_request desiredState=public on a currently-hidden TEST member, 1 delete_request on a currently-undeleted TEST member) to existing TEST-MEM accounts via apps/api/src/testing/test-accounts/catalog.ts + build-seed-sql.ts, regenerate committed test-accounts-seed.sql / test-accounts-cleanup.sql (note_id TEST-NOTE-V01/V02/D01, created_by seed:test-accounts), so staging shows live rows in the requests queue. (B) RENAME + ROLE CLARITY — change ONLY human-readable display text + aria-labels: sidebar nav / page title / panel h1 / breadcrumb (ja) / 依頼一覧 / 依頼詳細 / empty-state from 依頼キュー family to 会員からの申請 / 申請一覧 / 申請詳細; add explanatory copy distinguishing member-initiated approval from admin-initiated immediate toggle; add a cross-link to 会員管理. Route path /admin/requests, API paths, component file names, ids, data-* attributes and test selectors stay UNCHANGED. (C) MEMBER MGMT 申請中 BADGE + CROSS-LINK + API — add a correlated subquery to GET /members projecting pendingRequestTypes (json_group_array(DISTINCT note_type) where request_status='pending'), extend AdminMemberListViewZ member item with pendingRequestTypes: string[] and mirror the web zod; render a 申請中 badge on member rows that have a pending request, linking to /admin/requests?type=<noteType>; add an explanatory line + cross-link on 会員管理 page. No new endpoint, no D1 schema change (admin_member_notes already exists; seed-only), apps/web never touches D1 directly, OKLch tokens only (no HEX). Out of scope (Q4 not selected): GET /api/admin/members/TEST-MEM-01 500 fix, approval before->after publish-state diff display — recorded as Phase 12 baseline candidates only.",
